OL,3,GNEWSAStriking doctors warn staff will
OL,4,Aleave NI health service for better pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoctors involved in a 24-hour strike
OL,7,Fover pay have warned more health staff
OL,8,Fwill leave Northern Ireland for higher
OL,9,Fwages and better conditions elsewhere.
OL,11,FOisin Fearon, who works in Belfast, is
OL,12,Famong the resident doctors taking
OL,13,Faction after British Medical
OL,14,FAssociation (BMA) members rejected a
OL,15,Fpay rise offer of 3.5%.
OL,17,FHe said many of his colleagues have
OL,18,Falready "emigrated to as far away as
OL,19,FAustralia and even America; New Zealand
OL,20,Fand it is definitely something that has
OL,21,Fcrossed my mind".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
