OL,3,GNEWSAStriking doctors warn staff will
OL,4,Aleave NI health service for better pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Minister Robbie Butler said he
OL,7,Fwould try to do "everything in my
OL,8,Fpower" to implement the pay award - but
OL,9,Fsaid he was unable to do so at present
OL,10,Fin the absence of a Stormont budget.
